The “command” system is clunky and also really hard to see right now. Its submenu tends to collapse outside of view. Need to work on the UI for it.

A “watchtower” building, based on the multi-story system we have in place. Ideally it also allows for much further vision, like mountains but even more expanded

Currently its impossible to bandage people from other factions. It would be nice to do so especially for escort missions. Even enemies for later capture. (Make sure the “medic” job ONLY bandages actual allies though.) 

The melee pathing system seems to have gone a bit janky. Everyone tries to beeline towards the enemy and gets caught on allies. They should attempt to flank around where possible. (Could be an unintended side effect of the “walling” effect we built to prevent enemies from beelining through allies to attack mages etc.) 

